        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of a common atrioventricular valve with both an ostium primum atrial septal defect and an inlet ventricular septal defect confirmed by echocardiography",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily based on echocardiographic findings in neonates or infants presenting with cardiac symptoms."
